<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">FILIPIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipifoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">FILIPIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIPIFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa he kɔyɛ afoɛ 60-61 Y.A, na sɔ mmerɛ ne, né baha ye bawura awuro<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ ne bama ye </char><char style="it">house arrest.</char></note> wɔ Roman. Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nanu ne, onyane anisoadehu bie wɔ Troa. Ná Makedonianiɛ bie ha hyirele ye kyɛ “Bra Makedonia na baboka yɛ.” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:9">Aso 16:9</ref></char>) Yeti, kɔyɛ afoɛ 50 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> ne, Paul ne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne hyɛle yebo hane nzɛmba ne wɔ Makedonia kuro bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Filipi nanu. Paul tele asafo wɔ berɛ, nakoso oyiale ɔtaeɛ paa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛfale mmakaa bɛbole ɔne Silas, na bɛfale bɛ bɛguale prizin, yeɛ bɛkyekyele bɛ gya bɛbɔle mmakaa nu ɔ. Ɛhene si ne, ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nná nanu ne, osa hɔle Filipi, na ye krataa ne maa yɛnwu ɔdɔ bɔ ɔne aliemaa mɔ le ma bɛ nwo ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔ yeti yeɛ ɔhworɔle sɔ krataa he yeɛ ole kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né ɔpena kyɛ bɛnwu ye kyɛ, anwonyerɛ bɔ ɔbɔle Epafrodito ne, ye nwo atɔ ye;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né ɔhyɛ bɛ nguraen kyɛ bɛtira bɛ gyidie nanu;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né ɔpena kyɛ bɛnwu ye kyɛ, ye nwo te pa;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né ɔda bɛ ase kyɛ bahɔso baboka ye ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Paul hyɛle Filipifoɛ nemɔ nguraen kyɛ bɛbɔ bɛ bra kyɛ bɛte maen mmaa wɔ anwuro. Ɔbaayie ye krataa ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛmaa dadwene biala hyɛ bɛ so, mmom bɛfa bɔ ohia bɛ ne bɛto Nyameɛ nyunu, na ɔkɔmaa bekonya ye asomdwie. —<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:6">Flp 4:6</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul ka nningyein biemɔ bɔ ɔkɔhora kosi kyẽabie. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Suban bɔ odikyɛ Kristofoɛ nya ye. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27–2:18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔbaasoma Timoteo ne Epafrodito kɔ Filipi. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛ bɔ bɛpira mmenia ne. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-11">3:1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nneasoɛ bɔ Paul yɛ mane Filipifoɛ nemɔ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:12-4:1">3:12–4:1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔsrɛ bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ kõ, na bɛli ahurusi. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:2-5">4:2-5</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Asomdwie Nyameɛ ne kɔma ɛmɔ asomdwie. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:6-9">4:6-9</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul kyire kyɛ ye nye sɔ bɔ bayɛ bama ye ne. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4:10-23</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Kristo Yesu ngoaa Paul ne Timoteo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">yɛfa krataa he yɛkɔma Kristo Yesu nu akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Filipi namukoraati, bɔ asafo nu mbanyi<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Nneafoɛ”</char></note> ne asomvoɛ nemɔ koso boka so:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Sɛ ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ pe me ti anu biala a, meda Nyameɛ ase. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Na mmerɛ biala bɔ ngɔbɔ mbaeɛ ngɔma ɛmɔ ne, mefa anigye meyɛ sɔ, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ofikyɛ, ofi kyẽa bɔ ɛmɔtele nzɛmba ne tonn bɔ ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ ne, ɛmɔ aboka maa wahɔ ye nyunu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Na medɛ́ medi kyɛ, ye bɔ ɔhyɛle adwuma pa bo wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, kyɛ dee bɔ Kristo Yesu kyẽa ne bra ne, né wayie. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔla m'ahone so nati, ɔte pa kyɛ ngonya sɔ adwene ne ngɔfa ɛmɔ mukoraati nwo. Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati, né ɛmɔta me si, mmerɛ bɔ bɛfale kyenyi bɛguale me sa, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ mmɔle nzɛmba nanwo waen wɔ mmeraa atee so ne. Yeti, mene ɛmɔ mukoraati anya adom ne bie. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Kyɛbɔ mafe ɛmɔ mukoraati ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ odi me adanzeɛ ɔ. Na kyɛbɔ Yesu Kristo kuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ mekuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Na me mbaeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne, ɔkɔhɔ so konyi wɔ nimdeɛ ne ndeaseɛ mukoraati nu, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konwu nningyein bɔ ɔte pa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ye nwo hia paa ne”</char></note> ne, ná ɛmɔ ayɛ mmenia bɔ ɛmɔ abrabɔ te kama, ná ɛmɔ ando ebiala sintidua kodwu kyẽa bɔ Kristo kɔwa ne. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Afei koso, tenenee mmaa bɔ Yesu Kristo ma ɛmɔsu ne, okoyi ɛmɔ dɛen, na wafa anuonyam ne ayɛyie wabrɛ Nyameɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Aliemaa mɔ, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu kyɛ, bɔ wato me ne, wamaa nzɛmba ne atrɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />ofikyɛ kyenyi bɔ bafa bagua me ne, awaen ne sogyafoɛ namukoraati ne ebiala ate kyɛ, Kristo ti yeɛ nna prizin ne. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Na kesaalae, kyenyi bɔ bafa bagua me sa wɔ prizin wa nati, aliemaa mɔ pee anya akukuduro wɔ Awurade nu, na bɛka Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne bɔ bɛnzuro hwee.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ, ebiemɔ fa anyeborolɛ ne akansie bɛka Kristo nwo dwirɛ ne, nakoso ebiemɔ de, adwene pa yeɛ bɛfa bɛka ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bɛ bɔ bɛfa adwene pa bɛka Kristo nwo dwirɛ ne, bɛyɛ ye wɔ ɔdɔ nu, ofikyɛ bɛse kyɛ baye me kyɛ mmɔ nzɛmba nanwo waen. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛfa anyeborolɛ ne akansie bɛka Kristo nwo dwirɛ ne de, ahoɔyaa ti yeɛ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, b'adwene yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛyɛ sɔ a, ɔkɔmaa me nwo kɔhyere me wɔ prizin wa. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Nakoso, nzu yeɛ wafi nu wawa ɔ? Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ bɛyɛ ye wɔ sona nye so oo, sɛ bɛyɛ ye nahorɛ nu oo, Kristo nwo dwirɛ komapɛ nala yeɛ bɛka ɔ. Na ɛhe maa me nye gye, na ngɔhɔ so ngoli ahurusi, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />ofikyɛ mese kyɛ, ɔnate ɛmɔ mbaeɛ, ne Yesu Kristo honhom nati, ngonya ngoa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ɛhe yeɛ menea ye atee paa, na me nye la so ne, na mese kyɛ me nyunu ngogua ase lle, mmom kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ngoa nu oo, ewue nu oo, ngonya akukuduro wɔ me nipadua nu ngɔye Kristo ayɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Na me de, Kristo ti yeɛ nde ase ɔ, na sɛ mewu a, ɔte mvasoɛ ma me. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Na sɛ metena ase wɔ anwoɔnaen nu a, ɔkɔmaa m'adwuma kɔhɔ ye nyunu. Nakoso bɔ ngɔyɛ ne de, menze.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mengɔha.”</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Nningyein nyɔ ne, mennwu bɔ ɔte pa ɔ. Nyane ye a, ahaa manya me nwo matete maaboka Kristo so, ɛhene mmom yeɛ ahaa ɔte pa ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Nakoso ɛmɔ ti, odikyɛ metena ase wɔ anwoɔnaen nu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Nne gyidie wɔ ɛhe anu, yeti mese kyɛ ngɔnwondɛ, na mene ɛmɔ mukoraati atena ase, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya ngɔsoɛ ne anigye wɔ gyidie nanu, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />na sɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ a, me ti, ɛmɔ ali ahurusi maa waboso wɔ Kristo Yesu nu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Yeti, ɛmɔbɔ ɛmɔ bra ma ɔfata Kristo nzɛmba ne, na sɛ mebasra ɛmɔ oo, mamma oo, mate ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ agyina pindinn wɔ honhom kõ anu, ná ɛmɔfa ɔkra kõ bɛ pere bɛma nzɛmba nanwo gyidie ne, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />bɔ ɛmɔnzuro bɛ bɔ bɛdwɔso betia ɛmɔ ne. Ɛhe te adanzeɛ bɔ okyire kyɛ bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ, na balɛ́ ɛmɔ ngoa, na ofi Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Na ɛmɔ yeɛ Kristo ti, bafa ye nwo atee he bama ɛmɔ ɔ, nná kyɛ ɛmɔnya yenu gyidie mbaen, mmom yeti, odikyɛ ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Ná koɛ komapɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nwuni kyɛ mekõ, ná ɛmɔte kyɛ ndɛ́ kõ ne, ɛhene ala bie yeɛ ɛmɔ kõ ne.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Yeti, sɛ ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔhyɛ ebie nguraen wɔ Kristo nu, sɛ ɛmɔ kɔkyekye ebie wora wɔ ɔdɔ nu, sɛ honhom nu adamvoa bie wɔ berɛ, na sɛ ahunu-ndetelɛ ne anwunvoin bie wɔ berɛ a, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />ye de, sɛ ɛmɔnya adwene kõ, ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo, ɛmɔyɛ kõ, na ɛmɔnya botae kõ a, na ɔkɔmaa m'anigye koli mu. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Nnɛmɔfa manzoin<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Pɛsɛmengominya.”</char></note> anaa nduhoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahomasoɛ.”</char></note> bɛyɛ nikye fee, mmom ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase, na ɛmɔbu afoforɛ kyɛ bɛtra ɛmɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Nná bɔ ohia ɛmɔ ngome yeɛ odikyɛ ɛmɔdwene ye nwo ɔ, mmom ɛmɔdwene ɛmɔ mmango mɔ nwo.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ɛmɔnya adwene bɔ ne Kristo Yesu le ye ne bie:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ɔwɔ nu, né ye tebea ne ayɛ kyɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">nakoso, wannya adwene lle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">kyɛ ɔne Nyameɛ kɔyɛ pɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Mmom, ɔyakyile nikye biala berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">yɛle ye nwo te kyɛ akoaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">na ɔwa maa bɛwole ye kyɛ kuro sona.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ ɔte sona ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">ɔbrɛle ye nwo ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">na ɔyɛle sotie tonn oodwule ewue nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">asɛnnua so wue nu.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Yeti, Nyameɛ apagya ye ahɔ anwuro paa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">na wama ye dumaa bɔ ɔtra dumaa biala.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Yeti, Yesu dumaa nu yeɛ odikyɛ ebiala<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Nangoroma biala.”</char></note> koto ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro, aseɛ so, ɔne aseɛ bo mukoraati.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Ná odikyɛ temverema biala ka kyɛ Yesu Kristo te Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">na ɔfa hyɛ Baba Nyameɛ anuonyam.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Yeti adɔfo, kyɛbɔ daa ɛmɔyɛ sotie mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ berɛ, na nne berɛ po a, ɛmɔyɛ maa ɔbo so ne, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛfa esuronyi ne ahopopo bɛyɛ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ ngoa nwo adwuma. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ ɛmɔ nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konya ye nwo anigye, ná ɛmɔ anya anwoserɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkɔyɛ bɔ okuro ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Nnɛmɔfa anwii-nwii ne aporowaa bɛyɛ nikye fee, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />ná wamaa ɛmɔ ayɛ mmenia bɔ edwirɛ nne bɛ nwo, ná ɛmɔte kronn, Nyameɛ mmaa bɔ ngekayɛɛ biala nne bɛ nwo wɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ bɔ wakondo na wahyea he anu, na ɛmɔ ata kyɛ kanea wɔ wiase, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />bɔ ɛmɔtira ngoa dwirɛ nanu. Ná kyẽa bɔ Kristo kɔwa ne, me koso mahora mali ahurusi, ofikyɛ mese kyɛ manndu mirika ne mbaen, na mamvɛ mangua. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Na sɛ ɔba kyɛ bɛhwie me kyɛ nzãa afɔleɛ bɛgua ɛmɔ afɔleɛ, ne ɔsom adwuma bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie ti ɛmɔyɛ naso a, ɔyɛ me fɛ, na mene ɛmɔ mukoraati di ahurusi. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Yeti, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye, na ɛmɔ ne me li ahurusi.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Me nye la so wɔ Awurade Yesu nu kyɛ, ɔngɔhyɛ ngɔsoma Timoteo ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, na sɛ ɔmaa mete ɛmɔ nga a, m'ahone kɔtɔ me kunu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nnne ebiala bɔ ɔkofia ye kunu koli ɛmɔ haw nwo dwumaa te kyɛ ye ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Bɛ ngaa ne de, bɛ ngome bɛ nwo yeɛ bɛdwene ɔ, bɛndwene Yesu Kristo adwene. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔse ne, Timoteo de, ɔne me yɛle adwuma te kyɛ akwalaa ne ye baba maa yɛtrɛle nzɛmba nanu. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Me nye la so kyɛ, sɛ menya menwu bɔ ɔkɔ ala pɛ, ngɔsoma ye. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Na nne gyidie wɔ Awurade nu kyɛ, me bɔbɔ ngɔwa dɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Nakoso, kesaalae de, menwu ye kyɛ odikyɛ mesoma Epafrodito meba ɛmɔ berɛ. Ɔte nniema bɔ mene ye yɛ adwuma, ná wayɛ kyɛ me mmango sogyaniɛ; matu ye kyɛ ɔɔso ɛmɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Wafe ɛmɔ paa; na ɔha ye kyɛ ɛmɔtele kyɛ ne wafokyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Né wafokyɛ paa, ahaa owu, nakoso Nyameɛ nwuni ye anwunvo, nná ye ngome, me koso onwuni me anwunvo, na wamma me wora ammɔ soma. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Yeti mesoma ye ndɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ, na sɛ ɛmɔnwu ye bieku a, ɛmɔ nye kɔgye, na m'adwene-dwene so ate. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Yeti, ɛmɔfa anigye bɛle ye kama wɔ Awurade nu, na ɛmɔfa nidie bɛma mmenia bɔ bɛte sɔ ne, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />ofikyɛ Kristo adwuma nati, ɔhale dɛ́, ahaa owu, na ɔfale ye ngoa tole asane nu sili ɛmɔ gya nu sone me, ofikyɛ ne ɛmɔnne wa.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Afei nniema mɔ, ɛmɔli ahurusi wɔ Awurade nu, ɔnha me kyɛ ngɔhworɔ nikye komapɛ nala ngɔ berɛ ɛmɔ bieku ɔ, ɛhene mmom yeɛ ɔkɔbɔ ɛmɔ nwo waen ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ sɔ ngyea nemɔ nwo, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛpira mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔ bɛyɛ nningyein tɛɛ.”</char></note> nanwo, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ bɛ bɔ basɔ toa pɛlɛ nu twann nanwo. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ofikyɛ yɛ mmom yeɛ bapɛ yɛ toa paa ɔ, yɛ bɔ yɛnate Nyameɛ honhom naso yɛyɛ ɔsom adwuma, yɛ bɔ yɛhoɔhoa yɛ nwo wɔ Kristo Yesu nu, ná yɛmva yɛ nwo yɛndo anwoɔnaen so ne. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ahaa ngɔhora ngɔfa me nwo ngɔto sɔ nningyein naso. Sɛ ebie adwene yɛ ye kyɛ, ole nikye bɔ ɔkɔfa kɔhoɔhoa ye nwo anwoɔnaen nu a, nne pee: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Bɛwole me ne, kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so mmɔtwɛ ne yeɛ bɛpɛle me toa ɔ; nde Israelniɛ bɔ ofi Bengyamin abusua nu, Hebriniɛ paa;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nde Hebriniɛ bɔ Hebrifoɛ yeɛ bɛwole me ɔ.”</char></note> sɛ ɔba mmeraa nu koso a, nde Farisiniɛ, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />sɛ bɛka ebie bɔ ɔbɔ ye nwo mmɔden a, nduli me nye nziele asafo naso paa; na sɛ ɔba mmeraa nanwo tenenee a, nde ebie bɔ edwirɛ nne ye nwo. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Nakoso nningyein bɔ né menwu ye kyɛ mvasoɛ wɔ so ne, Kristo ti, menwu ye kyɛ mvasoɛ nne so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Wafi me sa.”</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, m'Awurade Kristo Yesu nwo nimdeɛ bɔ waboso nati, mebu nningyein mukoraati kyɛ mvasoɛ nne so. Ye ti, mebu nningyein mukoraati kyɛ bɔla bie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a me sa kɔha Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />na wanwu kyɛ mene ye ayɛ kõ. Nakoso ɔtte me bɔbɔ me tenenee bɔ ɔnate mmeraa naso ne, mmom tenenee bɔ ɔnate Kristo nu gyidie so, Nyameɛ tenenee bɔ ogyi gyidie so ne. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Bɔ ogyi me nye so yeɛ ole kyɛ ngonwu Kristo, ngonwu tumi bɔ bɛfa bɛtingyele ye ne, ngonwu ye amaneɛ ne bie, ná mawu ye wue bie, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />na sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, maboka bɛ bɔ bɛkoli moa bɛkotingye bɛ naso.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ɔtte kyɛ ebia manya ɛhe dada, anaa mali mu mayie, na mmom bɔ yeti yeɛ Kristo Yesu yele me ne, mebɔ mmɔden menea sɛ́ ngodwu ye nwo a. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Aliemaa mɔ, mennwu me nwo kyɛ me sa aha ye dada, mmom nikye kõ yeɛ ole kyɛ, me maa me wora fi bɔ wapɛ nu ne, na metwe me nu kyɛ ngodwu bɔ ɔwɔ me nyunu nanwo, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />mebɔ mmɔden kyɛ ngodwu botae nanwo, na wamaa me sa aha abasobɔdeɛ ne. Sɔ abasobɔdeɛ ne yeɛ ole anwuro frɛlɛ ne, na Nyameɛ kɔfa kɔma bɛ bɔ ɔnate Kristo Yesu so afrɛ bɛ ne. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Yeti, yɛbɔ yɛ nwo akwokwa ne, ɛmɔma yɛnya sɔ adwene ne, na sɛ ɛmɔle adwene foforɛ bie a, Nyameɛ kɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu adwene bɔ ɔfata ne. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Na nekaa bɔ yanya ngɔsoɛ yadwu ne, ɛmɔma yɛhɔ so yɛnate sɔ atee naso pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔsuesua me, na bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ bɛ bra kyɛbɔ yɛyɛle ye nwo nneasoɛ yɛmane ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔnea bɛ koso. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ebiemɔ wɔ berɛ a né metaa mebɔ bɛ dumaa, nakoso kesaalae, mebɔ bɛ dumaa a, né mesu, ofikyɛ bayɛ Kristo asɛnnua nanwo atamfo. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Bɛ awieɛ kɔyɛ sɛkyelɛ, bɛ nyameɛ yeɛ ole bɛ ko, na bɛ anuonyam yeɛ ole animguaseɛ. B'adwene wɔ aseɛ he aso nningyein so. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Nakoso yɛ de, anwuro yeɛ ɔte yɛ maen, na ɛberɛ yeɛ yɛnwondɛ paa kyɛ Awurade Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔte y'Agyenkwa ne kofi kɔwa ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ye yeɛ ɔkɔfa ye tumi bɔ ɔkora maa ɔfa nningyein mukoraati wura ye bo naso kɔsesa yɛ nipadua bɔ ɔba ase he, maa ɔkɔyɛ kyɛ ye deɛ bɔ ole anuonyam ne.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Yeti, nniema mɔ, medɔ ɛmɔ, na mafe ɛmɔ paa, ɛmɔte meanigye ne m'abotire. Adɔfo, ɛmɔgyina pindinn sɔ ala wɔ Awurade nu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Mesrɛ Euodia ne Sintike kyɛ benya adwene kõ wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Na me damvo bɔ mene wɔ yɛ adwuma,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Me damvo bɔ edi nahorɛ bɔ mene wɔ soa kɔnnua.”</char></note> mesrɛ wɔ, boka sɔ mmrasua hemɔ; né bɛboka me so mmerɛ bɔ né meyɛ nzɛmba nanwo adwuma ne; bɛne Klɛment ne me mmango mɔ bɔ mene bɛ yɛ adwuma namu. Bɛ mukoraati bɛ dumaa wɔ ngoa nwomaa nanu.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Ɛmɔli ahurusi wɔ Awurade nu daa, meka ye bieku: Ɛmɔli Ahurusi! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Ɛmɔma ebiala nwu ye kyɛ ɛmɔte edwirɛ bo. Awurade apingye. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Nnɛmɔ maa dadwene biala hyɛ ɛmɔ so, mmom nikye biala nu ne, ɛmɔfa mbaebɔ, ngotosrɛ, ne asennaa so bɛfa bɔ ohia ɛmɔ ne bɛto Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Na Nyameɛ asomdwie bɔ ɔbo ndeaseɛ mukoraati so ne, ɔnate Yesu Kristo so kɔbɔ ɛmɔ ahone ne ɛmɔ adwene nwo waen.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, nikye biala bɔ ɔte nahorɛ, nikye biala bɔ odi mu, nikye biala bɔ ɔtengyɛ, nikye biala bɔ ye nwo te, nikye biala bɔ ɔyɛ nyemene, nikye biala bɔ ole dumaa pa, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ɔfata ayɛyie ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔdwene ye nwo ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Bɔ ɛmɔ asua bafi me berɛ, bɔ ɛmɔ alɛ́ bato nu, bɔ ɛmɔ ate, ɔne bɔ ɛmɔ anwu wɔ me nwo ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ. Na asomdwie Nyameɛ ne, ɔne ɛmɔ kɔtena.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ɔyɛ me fɛ paa wɔ Awurade nu kyɛ, afei de ɛmɔsa bɛdwene me nwo bieku ɔ. Né ɛmɔdwene me nwo, nakoso, ɛmɔ annya atee banna ye ali. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ɔtte kyɛ me nwo ahyere me ti yeɛ meka ɛhe ɔ, ofikyɛ masua kyɛ, kyɛbɔ tebea ne te biala ne, ngɔmaa me nye kɔsɔ bɔ nne ye biala. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mese hiaa di paa, na mese atee bɔ bɛfa so benya bɛ nwo ɔ. Nikye biala nu, ne tebea biala nu ne, sɛ me ko ayi oo, mekye ɛhɔen oo, nne bie oo, wahia me oo, masua kyɛbɔ ngɔtena ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Kristo bɔ ɔma me anwoserɛ nati, mekora meyɛ nikye biala.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ɛmɔ ayɛ nikye paa kyɛ ɛmɔ anwu m'amaneɛ ne bie ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Filipifoɛ, ɛmɔse ye koso kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔli moa bɛtele nzɛmba ne, mmerɛ bɔ mvili Makedonia ne, asafo biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔne me hyɛle nningyein ɔ, sana ɛmɔ ngome. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ne nwɔ Tɛsalonika ne po, ɛmɔ fale bɔ mehia bɛbrɛle me, ɛmɔ anyɛ kõ, mmom ɛmɔ yɛle ye pɛnyɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Nná akyɛdeɛ yeɛ mepena ɔ, mmom mmaa bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konya mvasoɛ yeɛ ohia me ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Manya bɔ mehia biala maa wabu so, na kesaalae bɔ me sa aha ɛmɔ akyɛdeɛ bɔ ofi Epafrodito dɔ ne po de, hwee nhia me kõ. Bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛwale ne, ɔbo fona, na ɔte afɔleɛ bɔ ɔfata na ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Na ɔnate kyɛ, me Nyameɛ ahonyadeɛ sone nati, ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ sa kɔha bɔ ɛmɔ hia biala, nate Yesu Kristo so. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Yɛ Nyameɛ ne yɛ Baba ne, ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye daa daa. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ɛmɔhyea akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Kristo Yesu nu namukoraati bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:21">Aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ me nwo wa ne nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Akrongronfoɛ namukoraati nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ, ɛnga-nga bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Kaesare awuro berɛ ne.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom ha ɛmɔ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔda suban pa ali ne.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>